<h4>Additional Information</h4>
<ul>
<li>TMM was the method used to normalise library sizes.</li>
<li>The limma-voom method was used.</li>
<li>Weights were not applied to samples.</li>
<li>eBayes was used with robust settings (robust = TRUE).</li>
<li>MD Plot highlighted genes are significant at FDR of 0.05 and exhibit log2-fold-change of at least 0.5.</li>
</ul>
